LWJGL 3 (https://github.com/LWJGL/lwjgl3), BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2012-present Lightweight Java Game Library.
  runtime/glfw-shim: the org.lwjgl.glfw class names, method signatures and GLFW constants follow
  LWJGL 3.4.1 so the shim can replace LWJGL's GLFW classes on the game classpath.

PojavLauncher (https://github.com/PojavLauncherTeam/PojavLauncher), LGPL-3.0.
  runtime/glfw-shim and runtime/src/main/cpp: the design of a Java-side GLFW replacement fed by a
  native event queue shared with ART, and the JRE start-up sequence (library load order,
  LD_LIBRARY_PATH update, JLI_Launch on our own thread), are modelled on jre_lwjgl3glfw,
  jre_launcher.c, utils.c and JREUtils.java.

Bundled Java runtime, unpacked on first launch:
  OpenJDK 25.0.5 (jdk-25.0.5-ga, https://github.com/openjdk/jdk25u), GPL-2.0 with the Classpath
  Exception where designated; HotSpot GPL-2.0. Its bundled third-party components keep their
  notices in legal/java/<module>. Android port patches follow the MojoLauncher /
  PojavLauncher OpenJDK patch lineage under the OpenJDK source licenses; one bionic snippet keeps
  its AOSP BSD-2-Clause notice (legal/java/cofre-port).

